<%#
# DateTime Form Partial

Replaces the Administrate partial: the input holds Astana wall-clock time
(UTC+5). The controllers of the resources that edit a time convert it back
(`SuperAdmin::DisplayHelper.parse_input`).

## Local variables:

- `f`: the form builder.
- `field`: an `Administrate::Field::DateTime`.
%>

<div class="field-unit__label">
  <%= f.label field.attribute %>
</div>
<div class="field-unit__field">
  <%= f.datetime_local_field field.attribute, step: 1, value: super_admin_input_time(field.data) %>
  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-n-slate-11"><%= t('super_admin.shell.astana_time_hint') %></p>
</div>
